invariant: INV-16
file: src/aead_avx512.c
catches: aead_avx512_equiv_test
reason: each pass of the AVX-512 open absorbs its output in place of its input,
  so a separate output gives the tag of bytes the open has not yet written
  and every open of AEAD_AVX512_MIN bytes or more into a separate buffer
  fails. bin/aead_avx512_equiv_test opens into a separate buffer over the
  lane models on every machine.

--- old
        pass_hashing(words, pass_counter(index), ct + offset, pt + offset, PASS_BYTES, ct + offset,
--- new
        pass_hashing(words, pass_counter(index), ct + offset, pt + offset, PASS_BYTES, pt + offset,
